From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner crypto engine hash and
 TRNG

The sun8i-ce module provides the hash algorithms and the TRNG of the
Allwinner crypto engine only with these options. Switch them on, as part
of the module, so that the A733 hash unit, which computes both, is used.
This switches them on for every SoC with this engine; they were tested
on the A733 only.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: with both options the hash algorithms and the
TRNG of the engine are registered and used.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index e7bb7e6a0e25..8f8a6de93e84 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1960,6 +1960,8 @@ CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_BLK=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_BS=m
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_CCM=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_SUN8I_CE=m
+CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_SUN8I_CE_HASH=y
+CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_SUN8I_CE_TRNG=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_FSL_CAAM=m
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_FSL_DPAA2_CAAM=m
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_TEGRA=m
